---
import ChartScale from './ChartScale.astro';
---
<section id="account-view" class="view detail-view" aria-labelledby="account-detail-title" hidden>
  <header class="page-heading detail-page-heading">
    <div>
      <a id="account-detail-back" class="detail-back" href="#accounts" data-detail-back>← Back to accounts &amp; identities</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / ACCOUNT &amp; IDENTITY DETAILS</p>
      <h1 id="account-detail-title" tabindex="-1">Account details.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Explore the saved information and payments involving this account or sender/receiver.</p>
    </div>
    <ChartScale id="account-scale" />
  </header>
  <p id="account-detail-status" class="detail-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <p id="endpoint-membership-save-status" class="detail-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="account-detail-summary" class="metrics endpoint-summary"></div>
  <article id="account-activity-statistics" class="card statistics-card" aria-labelledby="account-activity-title"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PAYMENT PATTERNS</p><h2 id="account-activity-title">Activity in perspective</h2></div></div><dl id="account-activity-insights" class="statistics-grid statistics-grid-three"></dl><p class="input-note">Uses the account confirmation and category selected below, across all saved dates. Mirrored internal transfer entries count as one payment.</p></article>
  <article id="account-activity-chart-card" class="card statistics-card" aria-labelledby="account-activity-chart-title"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LONGER VIEW</p><h2 id="account-activity-chart-title">Payment activity over time</h2></div><span class="badge">Monthly</span></div><div id="account-activity-chart"></div><p class="chart-note">Follows account confirmation and category across all saved dates. First and last months may be partial. Includes internal movement for this account; paired transfer entries count once. Search and direction filter the history list only.</p></article>
  <div class="detail-grid endpoint-detail-grid">
    <article class="card detail-info-card" aria-labelledby="account-detail-info-title">
      <div class="card-heading"><h2 id="account-detail-info-title">Saved information</h2></div>
      <div id="account-detail-body" class="detail-record"></div>
      <div id="account-ownership-controls"></div>
      <p id="account-ownership-status" class="detail-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card detail-info-card" aria-labelledby="account-detail-identifiers-title">
      <div class="card-heading"><h2 id="account-detail-identifiers-title">Source evidence</h2></div>
      <p class="input-note">An account field may contain a bank identifier, a provider ID, or merchant text. The source evidence and your transaction membership decisions are separate.</p>
      <div id="account-detail-identifiers" class="detail-identifiers"></div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <article class="card endpoint-category-card" aria-labelledby="endpoint-category-title">
    <div class="card-heading"><h2 id="endpoint-category-title">Groups by category</h2></div>
    <p class="input-note">The account or merchant identifies where the money went. The category separates purposes such as food and electronics.</p>
    <div id="endpoint-category-groups" class="endpoint-category-groups"></div>
  </article>
  <article class="card transaction-card detail-history-card" aria-labelledby="endpoint-payments-title">
    <div class="card-heading"><h2 id="endpoint-payments-title">Payment history</h2><span id="endpoint-count" class="muted small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
    <div class="endpoint-filters">
      <label>Search payments<input id="endpoint-search" type="search" placeholder="Search a payment or category…" aria-controls="endpoint-transactions" /></label>
      <label>Direction<select id="endpoint-direction" aria-controls="endpoint-transactions"><option value="all">All directions</option><option value="incoming">Incoming</option><option value="outgoing">Outgoing</option></select></label>
      <label id="endpoint-status-label">Account confirmation<select id="endpoint-status" aria-controls="endpoint-transactions"><option value="active">Suggestions &amp; confirmed</option><option value="confirmed">Confirmed only</option><option value="suggested">Suggestions only</option><option value="dismissed">Dismissed accounts</option><option value="all">All source observations &amp; decisions</option></select></label>
      <label>Category group<select id="endpoint-category" aria-controls="endpoint-transactions"><option value="">All categories</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <p id="endpoint-scope-note" class="input-note"></p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="detail-payments-table">
        <caption class="sr-only">Payments involving this account or sender/receiver</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Payment</th><th scope="col">Sender → receiver</th><th scope="col" class="numeric">Amount</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="endpoint-transactions"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="pagination">
      <span id="endpoint-page-label" class="muted small"></span>
      <div><button id="endpoint-previous" type="button" class="outline-button" disabled>← Previous</button><button id="endpoint-next" type="button" class="outline-button" disabled>Next →</button></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
